<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367542/eurocert/m3.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="ISO 14001 Environmental Management"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Environmental management system standard</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">ISO 14001 â€” Environmental Management</h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Framework for effective environmental management and sustainability.</p></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Standard Overview</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">ISO 14001:2015 â€” <span class="text-euro-600">Environmental Management</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">ISO 14001:2015 standard concerns all companies aiming at improving their environmental performance. As concern for environmental protection becomes globally more intense day by day, more companies wish to prove their environmental awareness to their clients and interested parties by adopting and implementing an Environmental Management System.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">ISO 14001:2015 is a process standard. Therefore, it can be implemented by any company, regardless of its size or activity including product manufacturers or service providers.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-leaf text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">What is ISO 14001:2015?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">ISO 14001:2015 applies to implemented Environmental Management System and sets the requirements for what the organization should do to manage processes that affect the impact of its activities to the environment. The core of the standard is to identify and control the environmental aspects and impacts of the organization.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">The Plan-Do-Check-Act principle also applies to this standard. The expected outcome is the continual improvement of environmental performance by setting and achieving environmental targets and programmes. As in every management system, commitment by top management is a prerequisite and crucial.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[320px] md:h-[400px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784094518/14_o0sxzv.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="ISO 14001 Environmental Management"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Certification Benefits</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Benefits of ISO 14001:2015 <span class="text-euro-600">Certification</span></h2><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">The basic benefits from setting and implementing an Environmental System according to the requirements of ISO 14001:2015</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-coins text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Cost Reduction</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Reduction of operational and environmental cost.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-trophy text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Competitive Advantage</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Acquirement of competitive advantage in the market.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-gavel text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Legal Conformance</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Conformance with legal requirements and avoidance of authority environmental fines.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-bolt text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Energy Saving</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Significant energy saving through efficient resource management.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-users text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Employee Awareness</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Increase employees&#x27; environmental awareness across the organization.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-comments text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">External Communication</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Improvement of external communication with local community and interested parties.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-leaf text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Customer Confidence</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Address environmental concerns of customers and public effectively.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-globe-europe text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Sustainable Business</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Build a sustainable business model for long-term success.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Our Services</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">ISO 14001 <span class="text-euro-600">Services</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">ISO 14001 Certification &amp; Compliance</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Full scope verification and certification for Environmental Management System requirements under ISO 14001.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Comprehensive Audit &amp; Assessment</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Thorough on-site and documentation audits to evaluate your environmental management system effectiveness.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Training &amp; Consultancy</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Expert coaching and training for your teams on ISO 14001 implementation and environmental best practices.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-headset text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Ongoing Compliance Support</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Continuous monitoring and support to maintain your ISO 14001 certification and environmental standards.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-file-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Documentation &amp; Reporting</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Professional environmental documentation, impact assessments, and compliance reporting assistance.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-sync-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Remediation Support</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Fixing non-conformities and gaps identified during the environmental management assessment process.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Trusted Certification Partner</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Why Certify with Eurocert SA?</h3></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-building text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">About Eurocert</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Eurocert Asia is affiliated with Eurocert SA, Athens, Greece, which is a leading global independent third-party inspection, audit and certification body. Through this affiliation, clients benefit from internationally recognised accreditation, a worldwide footprint, and highly trained auditors with deep expertise in environmental management systems, ISO 14001, EMAS-style environmental assurance and related conformity assessment.</p><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Our teams combine that global backbone with practical knowledge of local and international environmental legislation to support implementation, audit readiness and certification decisions.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-award text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Our Expertise</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">EUROCERT has earned recognition in the field of environmental management system certification by conducting audits and awarding certificates globally according to ISO 14001, EMAS Regulation and Verification of Greenhouse Gas Emissions for many years.</p><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed font-medium">Certification with EUROCERT means evaluation and acceptance by an accredited, well-known and well-respected third-party organization.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-8"><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">25+</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Years Experience</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">Global</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Accreditations</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">100%</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Success Rate</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Have Questions?</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Frequently Asked <span class="text-euro-600">Questions</span></h2></div><div class="space-y-5"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-question text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Why certify?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">ISO 14001:2015 helps improve your company&#x27;s environmental performance and enhance your reputation in the market. Furthermore, in some companies, implementation of an Environmental Management System according to the requirements of ISO 14001:2015 or EMAS Regulation is an environmental condition stated in Permits or Licenses issued by the Ministry of Environment.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-clock text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">How long does it take to gain ISO 14001:2015 certification?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Typically 3-6 months, although this may depend on various factors. The main issue is that the company demonstrates that its management system is fully implemented and meets all the requirements of the standard. Top management and employees&#x27; level of awareness is also a crucial point to determine the necessary time for gaining certification.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-balance-scale text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Does it substitute public authority audits?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">No. ISO 14001:2015 is a voluntary certification aiming at continual improvement and does not substitute for any public or official audit. It organizes the company however, so that it complies with all relevant applicable legislation and helps avoiding any unexpected problems or fines during these audits acting pre-cautiously.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-8"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Explore More</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Related Certifications</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-4xl mx-auto"><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/management-system/iso-9001/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367536/eurocert/m2.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">ISO 9001</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Quality Management</span></div></a><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/management-system/iso-45001/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:go